7],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/i/article/2119…","expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2119765899368382464","indices":[244,267],"url":"https://t.co/G8aN1eOOcF"}]},"id_str":"2119769643749396581","text":"Grok Bot can now make your calls, sort your inbox and run your week while you sleep\n\nMost people still use it like a chatbot\n\nEverything it can do in one guide: first bot, routines, a full team, calls, and 5 rules that keep it off your money ↓ https://t.co/G8aN1eOOcF","user":{"id_str":"2564588272","name":"distort","screen_name":"distortgeekin","is_blue_verified":true,"profile_image_shape":"Circle","verified":false,"profile_image_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2119584354967924737/9_06iTu2_normal.jpg"},"edit_control":{"edit_tweet_ids":["2119769643749396581"],"editable_until_msecs":"1794231041000","edits_remaining":"5","is_edit_eligible":false},"article":{"cover_media":{"id":"QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHWrtgQBXAAAKAAIAAAAAmNyC8AAA","media_info":{"__typename":"ApiImage","original_img_height":1280,"original_img_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWrtgQBXAAAdWK8.jpg","original_img_width":3200}},"id":"QXJ0aWNsZUVudGl0eToyMTE5NzY1ODk5MzY4MzgyNDY0","preview_text":"Most people open Grok Bot, ask it something, read the answer and close the tab\nThat's a chatbot with a nicer sidebar\nThe people getting the most out of it do something else: they give every bot one","rest_id":"2119765899368382464","title":"Grok Bot: The Ultimate Guide (From Your First Bot to a Team That Works While You Sleep)"},"isEdited":false,"isStaleEdit":false},"isEdited":false,"isStaleEdit":false,"note_tweet":{"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0UmVzdWx0czoyMTI0NTAzMTg3NDIzODk5NjQ4"}}},{"tweet_id":"2124551042406789447","text":"This is f*cking insane. Anthropic senior engineer:\n\n\"Most people type one prompt into one chat and think they've built an agent\n\nI gave up on prompts. My agents live inside /loops + /graphs + /harness. Same model, same tokens, 10x more finished work, and it keeps shipping after I log off\"\n\nIn a 1-hour course, she puts together a team of agents that repair their own failures and improve with nobody touching them\n\nPrompt → Agent → Loop → Graph → Harness → A Team That Gets Better By Itself\n\nInside the loop, every agent plans, reviews its own output and tries again until it passes\n\nThe harness ties everything together: tools, memory and a way to recover when something breaks\n\nMost people blame the model, when the actual problem is everything around it\n\nWorth more than any $1,500 agent course\n\nSave it and watch it today\n\nThen read the full Opus 5.5 harness engineering guide below and build agents that bounce back from their own mistakes ↓","username":"Sownjuinho","tweet_url":"https://x.com/Sownjuinho/status/2124551042406789447","first_link":"https://x.com/Sownjuinho/status/2124551042406789447/video/1","created_at":"November 23, 2026 at 02:10AM","liked_at":"2026-11-23T13:11:22.859352","source":"ifttt","private":false,"notfound":false,"react_tweet_data":{"__typename":"Tweet","favorite_count":1539,"lang":"en","possibly_sensitive":false,"created_at":"2026-11-22T17:10:15.000Z","display_text_range":[0,280],"entities":{"media":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/kDqjahNXWA","expanded_url":"https://x.com/Sownjuinho/status/2124551042406789447/video/1","indices":[281,304],"url":"https://t.co/kDqjahNXWA"}]},"id_str":"2124551042406789447","text":"This is f*cking insane. Anthropic senior engineer:\n\n\"Most people type one prompt into one chat and think they've built an agent\n\nI gave up on prompts. My agents live inside /loops + /graphs + /harness. Same model, same tokens, 10x more finished work, and it keeps shipping after I https://t.co/kDqjahNXWA","user":{"id_str":"1801886426935476225","name":"Sownju","screen_name":"Sownjuinho","is_blue_verified":true,"profile_image_shape":"Circle","verified":false,"profile_image_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2102750331314544640/OtxhEUNO_normal.jpg"},"edit_control":{"edit_tweet_ids":["